opter has crashed the air force  says the cormorant helicopter was  conducting hovering maneuvers at the  gander airport prior to the accident in  a tweet the air force says six air crew  were on board two were in hospital  receiving treatment four have been  released and are back with their  squadron  from russia without love ahead how  russia's economy is being crushed  [Music]  western sanctions are having a  devastating impact on russia's economy  the currency the ruble has lost about 50  percent of its value since vladimir  putin invaded ukraine two weeks ago and  now takes about 120 russian rubles to  buy one u.s dollar russia's credit  rating has been downgraded to the second  lowest level possible by fitch ratings  which warns the country is on the brink  of defaulting on its debts  hundreds of foreign companies have  halted doing business in russia  including goldman sachs the first major  american bank to say it's pulling out of  the country and as eric sorenson reports  the russian people aren't getting the  full picture about why this is happening  the utter destruction of ukraine is not  being seen by the people whose country  is causing it state television where  most russians get their information  presents vladimir putin's message a  military operation welcomed by  ukrainians and sanitized for russian  consumption  many russians don't want to know as  radio free europe discovered  i support putin says this woman i won't  look at these photos  this man insists no one is bombing keeve  i don't believe it  and those who do believe it and speak  out are quickly rounded up and jailed  but no amount of propaganda or  censorship can shield everyday russians  from the global backlash  starting with long lineups for cash and  now seeing major companies pulling up  stakes some 300 businesses led by the  tech industry and payment systems are  pausing operations in russia from fast  food and fossil fuels to cars computers  and parkas one moscow resident who does